  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Altered Beast I** (1 other source): First performance since June 16, 2023, after a gap of 96 shows [1]\n- **Boogieman Sam** (1 other source): Included a guitar and harmonica duel between Joey and Amby [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Mirage City**: rare: 12 archived performances [5]\n- **Altered Beast I**: back after 109 archived shows (950 days); rare: 11 archived performances [5]\n- **Alter Me I**: back after 109 archived shows (950 days) [5]\n- **Altered Beast II**: back after 109 archived shows (950 days) [5]\n- **Chang'e**: rare: 9 archived performances [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2025-06-04.tora.m5** (recommended): source not stated; 17 songs; 135 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n- **kglw2025-06-04**: source not stated; 17 songs; 134 min [2]\n- **kglw2025-06-04.SBD.flac**: soundboard; 0 songs; 135 min [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Lycabettus Theatre staff hosted the band, who included Amby Kenny-Smith and Mickey Cavanagh [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2025-06-04.tora.m5**: taped by Tora Tapes; transferred by Jamie Downsworth; source: Røde M5 > Zoom F3 [1]\n- **kglw2025-06-04**: taped by puffanug; transferred by puffanug; source: ADK Thor > PMD661 > 24/48 wav [2]. Also: Recorded with ADK Thor and ORTF microphones, processed via PMD661 to FLAC [2]\n- **kglw2025-06-04.SBD.flac**: taped by Sam Joseph, Joe Santarpia, Grace Reader, Gaspard De Meulemeester; source: SBD [3]",
